📊 DecodeLab Data Analytics Internship Project

👩🏽‍💻 About the Project

This repository contains my project work and analysis completed during my 2026 Virtual Data Analyst Internship with DecodeLab.

The project focused on analysing an e-commerce dataset containing 1,200 records and 14 variables to uncover sales patterns, customer behaviour, product performance and actionable business insights.

The project allowed me to apply data analytics techniques across the complete analytical workflow — from data cleaning and exploratory analysis to visualisation, customer segmentation, machine learning and business recommendations.

---

🎯 Project Objectives

The main objectives of this project were to:

- Clean and prepare raw e-commerce data for analysis
- Explore sales and customer behaviour
- Identify trends and patterns within the dataset
- Analyse product and payment-method performance
- Identify unusual observations and outliers
- Segment customers based on purchasing behaviour
- Apply machine learning techniques to the data
- Develop data-driven recommendations that could support business decisions
- Communicate findings through effective visualisations and dashboards

